3. It is compulsory for all the shortlisted students to attend Criteria Assessment post registration.
4. Students should make sure to have a stable network connection throughout the virtual interview and join the meet 5 mins prior to the scheduled time.
5. Non-compliance with any of the stipulated rules is grounds for blacklisting.

